st.ts:54-105 and107-141 preserve a real native confirmation/row and exercise retry versus terminal/reconstruction with explicit policy-disposition stand-ins. They do not independently prove every remote chain/proof price. The joint fixture must use valid trust before its current-trust claim has meaning. All those assertions remain UNRUN. No numeric ARC sufficient-cohort proof follows from this review; the original pre-entry cost and chain-fit obligations remain with ARC-1.","body":{"stale_bases":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:50be54715b7dcdb3c1a39c33fa9b1d592c0911dd, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:50ce66503f7014ea324742cc4a0f9b9da05a4323 stale; retired bases: git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:b5750e6e82650d29470d64f83b0dc3a50115b466"}}